      "directions": [
        {
          "text": "使用 `write` 工具创建 `intervals.mjs`。核心机制：先对输入做元素级校验与浅拷贝（`const [s,e] = iv` 避免复用子数组），过滤掉 `s===e` 的空区间，按 `start` 升序排序，再用一次线性扫描合并——当 `next.start < current.end`（严格重叠），或 `mergeAdjacent` 为真且 `next.start <= current.end` 时扩展当前区间；否则推入结果并开启新区间。返回全新数组和全新区间对象。成立前提是“相邻”定义为 `next.start === current.end`，且排序后只需比较末尾。下一步：写文件后可用一组样例（乱序、相邻、空区间、非法输入）快速验证。",
          "valid": true
        },
        {
          "text": "Validate each element with a single pass checking `Array.isArray`, exact `length === 2`, both elements `typeof number && Number.isFinite` (TypeError), then `end < start` (RangeError); skip `start === end`. Sort a copied list by start, then fold left using a running `[s,e]`: merge when `next.start < current.end` (strict overlap) or, when `mergeAdjacent`, `next.start <= current.end`. Emit fresh two-element arrays at both sort and emit stages so no input subarray is reused. Key trade-off: sorting an O(n) copy gives O(n log n) and a clean single fold, versus a sweep/hash approach that complicates adjacency handling for no real gain; note NaN is already caught by `Number.isFinite`, and `Infinity` bounds are rejected as required since only finite values are allowed.",
          "valid": true
        }
